## Commandes Développement

### Setup Local
```bash
# Créer venv
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate  # Linux/Mac
# venv\Scripts\activate   # Windows

# Installer deps
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Télécharger modèles (à créer)
python scripts/download_models.py

# Lancer serveur dev
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
```

### Tests
```bash
# Test santé
curl http://localhost:8000/health

# Test prédiction
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/predict/multitask \
  -F "file=@test_image.jpg"

# Tests unitaires
pytest tests/

# Coverage
pytest --cov=app tests/
```

### Déploiement VPS

**1. Setup serveur**
```bash
# SSH VPS
ssh user@your-vps-ip

# Update système
sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y

# Installer Python 3.10
sudo apt install python3.10 python3.10-venv python3-pip -y

# Installer Nginx
sudo apt install nginx -y

# Créer user app
sudo useradd -m -s /bin/bash facesense
sudo su - facesense
```

**2. Déployer app**
```bash
# Clone repo
git clone https://github.com/votreuser/facesense-api.git
cd facesense-api

# Venv
python3.10 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate

# Install deps
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Télécharger modèles
python scripts/download_models.py

# Config .env
cp .env.example .env
nano .env  # Éditer config prod
```

**3. Systemd service**
```bash
# /etc/systemd/system/facesense-api.service
sudo nano /etc/systemd/system/facesense-api.service
```
```ini
[Unit]
Description=FaceSense FastAPI
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=facesense
WorkingDirectory=/home/facesense/facesense-api
Environment="PATH=/home/facesense/facesense-api/venv/bin"
ExecStart=/home/facesense/facesense-api/venv/bin/gunicorn \
    -w 4 \
    -k uvicorn.workers.UvicornWorker \
    --bind 127.0.0.1:8000 \
    --timeout 30 \
    --access-logfile /var/log/facesense/access.log \
    --error-logfile /var/log/facesense/error.log \
    app.main:app

Restart=always
RestartSec=3

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

**4. Nginx reverse proxy**
```bash
# /etc/nginx/sites-available/facesense-api
sudo nano /etc/nginx/sites-available/facesense-api
```
```nginx
upstream facesense_app {
    server 127.0.0.1:8000;
}

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name api.votredomaine.com;
    
    client_max_body_size 10M;
    
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://facesense_app;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        
        proxy_connect_timeout 30s;
        proxy_send_timeout 30s;
        proxy_read_timeout 30s;
    }
}
```
```bash
# Activer site
sudo ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/facesense-api /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/
sudo nginx -t
sudo systemctl restart nginx

# SSL avec Let's Encrypt (optionnel)
sudo apt install certbot python3-certbot-nginx -y
sudo certbot --nginx -d api.votredomaine.com
```

**5. Démarrer service**
```bash
# Créer log dir
sudo mkdir -p /var/log/facesense
sudo chown facesense:facesense /var/log/facesense

# Démarrer
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl start facesense-api
sudo systemctl enable facesense-api

# Vérifier
sudo systemctl status facesense-api
curl http://localhost/health
```

